{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;Milk Tea Time&quot; It's time to own the bubble tea shop of your dreams! Here, you can not only make bubble tea with your own hands, but also unleash your creativity to invent wild recipes and turn your little shop into the coolest bubble tea spot on the block!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/797893f5c5c207ed29bfefe78529215c.avif?t=1760531218\" width=602 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/9739d063ec57983e095fddb287e80c27.poster.avif?t=1760531218\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/9739d063ec57983e095fddb287e80c27.webm?t=1760531218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/9739d063ec57983e095fddb287e80c27.mp4?t=1760531218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 You Are the Chosen One of Bubble Tea \u2727</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the shop owner, you\u2019re in charge of everything\u2014taking orders, crafting drinks, and packing them up, all in one seamless flow! Just remember: a customer\u2019s patience sinks faster than pearls in milk tea. Your speed will determine whether your shop gets five-star reviews or\u2026 well, let\u2019s just say the opposite \ud83d\ude09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/5758fc2fe7ccba4ceeb0bbb4758cf497.poster.avif?t=1760531218\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/5758fc2fe7ccba4ceeb0bbb4758cf497.webm?t=1760531218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/5758fc2fe7ccba4ceeb0bbb4758cf497.mp4?t=1760531218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 Stock Up Like a Pro, Open Up Like a Boss \ud83d\uded2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure you\u2019ve stocked up on tea, milk, sugar, and pearls ahead of time\u2014don\u2019t wait until there\u2019s a line out the door to realize\u2026 oops, the coconut jelly\u2019s all gone! Start your day at your own pace, hit \u201cOpen for Business,\u201d and then\u2026 brace yourself for the tap-tap-tapping chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/58710f9ec4c3bee69120b5e1049f2afa.poster.avif?t=1760531218\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/58710f9ec4c3bee69120b5e1049f2afa.webm?t=1760531218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/58710f9ec4c3bee69120b5e1049f2afa.mp4?t=1760531218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea The Bubble Tea Lab Is Now Open \ud83e\uddea</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with new recipes and mix up mysterious flavors! Will it be taro bubble milk reigning supreme, or mint coffee making a surprise entrance? You call the shots! Go wild with hundreds of ingredients and create your very own \u201cquestionable\u201d specials\u2014mango mixed with coffee? cheese foam with chili? If you can imagine it, you can brew it! Complete mini-games, unlock hidden potential, and who knows\u2014your creation might just go viral!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/66ecc167e36ff6c3666c255130d23853.poster.avif?t=1760531218\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/66ecc167e36ff6c3666c255130d23853.webm?t=1760531218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/66ecc167e36ff6c3666c255130d23853.mp4?t=1760531218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 Design Freedom\u2014Your Style, Your Rules \ud83c\udfe1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the floor tiles to the pendant lights, from the shop layout to every tiny decoration\u2014every choice reflects your unique taste and creativity! Turn your shop into an Instagram-worthy hotspot where customers come not just for the tea\u2026 but to chill and share stories all day long!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/6f73a0a4d83919f9f7cb436bd25bcabc.poster.avif?t=1760531218\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/6f73a0a4d83919f9f7cb436bd25bcabc.webm?t=1760531218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/6f73a0a4d83919f9f7cb436bd25bcabc.mp4?t=1760531218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Meet Your Bubble Tea Mentors &amp; Tasty Challenges \ud83d\udc65</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly NPCs will act as your bubble tea gurus, guiding you from newbie to shake master. Meanwhile, picky foodies will throw tricky orders your way\u2014take on their challenges, earn rare ingredients, and always stay one recipe ahead of the trend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/986e48417d0187f5d029f596def99010.poster.avif?t=1760531218\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/986e48417d0187f5d029f596def99010.webm?t=1760531218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/extras/986e48417d0187f5d029f596def99010.mp4?t=1760531218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Uncle\u2019s Hunting for Recipes\u2014Around the World He Goes! \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support your adventure-loving uncle as he travels the globe in search of tea inspiration! Hunting for mysterious toppings in hidden valleys? Seeking the finest milk from highland pastures? All to uncover the legendary \u201cglow-in-the-dark\u201d ultimate recipe! Oh, and don\u2019t forget to fund his trips\u2014those plane tickets aren\u2019t cheap, you know \ud83d\ude09</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3334520?t=1760531218","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760531218","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/9600f029e2090ae2683c946a16a3be1a5cca3247/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760531218","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334520/9600f029e2090ae2683c946a16a3be1a5cca3247/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760531218","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id"